# A Claude Cloud launch on the root checkout: `n` opens the NEW SESSION PICKER, `Tab` flips the Claude
# row to cloud, `Enter` takes it and the default name, the task goes into the wrapped editor and `Enter`
# dispatches. The stand-in agent (see the .setup.sh) prints the session URL and exits, so the row's pane
# is the CLOUD SESSION PANEL rather than a terminal.
Tab
Tab
n
Tab
Enter
Fix the login redirect loop when the session cookie has expired
Enter
